WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.2 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Working out which policies you actually need

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A new initiative needs fewer policies than you think: choose them from what you will do.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Assess form, activities, geography, size, funders and risks.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Sort them: before you start, soon, or good practice.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Give each an owner, approver and review date.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You build a prioritised policy register for your launch and first year.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
